  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest for People People for Forest - Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with RFN&#x2019;s Colombiastrategy, the project will focus on enabling conditions for rainforest protection and sustainable
resource management in the Colombian Amazon, creating synergies with other interventions by RFN and partners and allies in Colombia. The project focuses on forest protection through improved rights and participation of local communities, including in policy development.</narrative>
  </description>
